[{"title":"送杜洲殷山长归天台二首 其二","author":"岑安卿","text":"词章汉宗正，诗笔李长庚。\n礼展慈湖奠，心摇微国旌。\n先公同窜谪，后裔借尊荣。\n侨馆甘藜藿，芳洲采杜蘅。\n春风闲杖策，夜雨短灯檠。\n浮海瞻龙仗，登皋听鹤鸣。\n三年书满考，一旦趣归程。\n执手论交契，持觞叙别情。\n但期趋玉陛，焉在遗金籯。\n旋舍斑衣舞，归舟綵帐轻。\n庭闱心晏晏，交友喜盈盈。\n侍次还乡举，趋班复帝京。\n捷音如我报，莫俟雁南征。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18243,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"危太朴以经筵检讨奉诏求故宋遗书作诗赠之 其一","author":"岑安卿","text":"宣文阁上危夫子，日侍经筵眷遇优。\n祗阅秘书供御览，旁求遗籍赞皇猷。\n琅琊南渡终承晋，昭烈西征亦继刘。\n公论自存千载下，圣人直笔在春秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18244,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"危太朴以经筵检讨奉诏求故宋遗书作诗赠之 其二","author":"岑安卿","text":"使星东下斗牛墟，潜德幽光待发舒。\n昭代进修三国史，词臣来购四方书。\n是非往事询黄发，咫尺清光动玉除。\n若问江淮今日政，愿陈比法话樵渔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18245,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"简王东皋","author":"岑安卿","text":"剑光飞射斗牛寒，应笑如今铗尚弹。\n万国梯航朝帝阙，百年礼乐付儒冠。\n黄金用尽无颜色，白发交深见肺肝。\n重念蒲轮东鲁客，暮年名动汉朝端。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18246,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送易直县尹兄赴松溪","author":"岑安卿","text":"武夷山水最清佳，路转三衢未觉赊。\n百里弦歌初作宰，一官琴鹤早辞家。\n夜凉灯影连书屋，溪近松声杂吏衙。\n遥想政成闲暇日，锦笺试墨品春茶。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18247,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次郑元秉陪刘同知谒子陵祠韵","author":"岑安卿","text":"画舫秋江集缙绅，公馀来吊故人魂。\n子陵名节千年墓，文叔云礽百世孙。\n高阁清风生玉麈，空山凉月堕金尊。\n独惭老朽无由到，只有新诗可共论。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18248,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"游东山寺赠尉东冈","author":"岑安卿","text":"东山景物吾州稀，莲宫璀璨浮春辉。\n过湖人骑白雪马，待客僧立青苔矶。\n花边举杯酒一斗，石上解衣松十围。\n最爱东冈老禅伯，夜窗为我谈玄机。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18249,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次叶敬常编修危太朴检讨东湖嘉泽庙倡和诗韵","author":"岑安卿","text":"太史文章星斗光，丛祠新制耀仙乡。\n两贤嘉泽千年在，万顷清风五月凉。\n烟际楼台澄晚色，雨馀兰芷发天香。\n经筵检讨临川彦，唱和尤闻感慨长。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18250,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"遣兴","author":"岑安卿","text":"去年不死今年活，直语半生人不禁。\n老去谤书从满箧，春来乐事总关心。\n观鱼濯足沧浪水，听鸟支筇杨柳阴。\n我已无心叫阊閤，玉皇高拱紫云深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18251,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"重峰寺祈雨后简李元善二律","author":"岑安卿","text":"麈尾高挥演大乘，火云不散愈崚嶒。\n漫同三岛吟诗客，閒访重峰醉酒僧。\n翠竹阴移凉梦远，碧莲香散暮云凝。\n归途未即天瓢注，犹有长风解郁蒸。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18252,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"重峰寺祈雨后柬李元善二律 其二","author":"岑安卿","text":"玉勒花骢达宦乘，我惟两脚踏崚嶒。\n山林不见休官客，云水何如问道僧。\n老鹤梦回清露滴，佳人信杳碧云凝。\n五旬不雨心如醉，赖有新篇破溽蒸。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18253,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送友","author":"岑安卿","text":"朝日昆邱彩凤鸣，秋风黄鹄共飞腾。\n朝廷自召杜清碧，草泽宁忘严子陵。\n万仞振衣□□□，□□□□□□□。\n□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18254,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题画三首 其一","author":"吴镇","text":"我爱晚风清，顺适随所赏。\n曩古竹林仙，忽忽竟长往。\n荒除杂废墟，几度蓬蒿长。\n可人日相亲，言笑容抵掌。\n靳馀一席宽，何用居求广。\n荷锄艺朮蔬，刮地芟草莽。\n举步山水长，引引支离杖。\n行役忘尔汝，啸答岩谷响。\n澹然入无何，朝来山气爽。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18255,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题画三首 其二","author":"吴镇","text":"我爱晚风清，漪漪动庭竹。\n惨澹暮云多，萧森分野绿。\n閒窗暝色佳，静赏欢易足。\n人生遽如许，万事徒碌碌。\n有尽壮士金，馀缪匹夫玉。\n轩车韫斧钺，粱肉隐耻辱。\n袅袅五株柳，采采三径菊。\n宁尽生前欢，毋贻死后哭。\n高歌晚风前，洗盏斟?醁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18256,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题画三首 其三","author":"吴镇","text":"我爱晚风清，新篁动清节。\n㗁㗁空洞手，抱此岁寒叶。\n相对两忘言，只可自怡悦。\n惜我鄙吝才，幽閒养其拙。\n野服支扶筇，时来苔上屧。\n夕阳欲下山，林间已新月。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18257,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题青山碧筱图","author":"吴镇","text":"青山白云绕，碧筱苍烟迷。\n幽人日无事，坐听山鸟啼。\n鸟啼有真趣，对景看山随所遇。\n乾坤浩荡一浮鸥，行乐百年身是寄。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18258,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"水墨梅松兰竹四友图","author":"吴镇","text":"砚池漠漠墨吐汁，苍髯呼风山鬼泣。\n涛声破梦铁骨冷，露影漙空翠毛湿。\n徂徕百亩老云烟，湖山九里甘萧瑟。\n何当置此明窗下，长对诗人弄寒碧。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18259,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画竹","author":"吴镇","text":"与可画竹不见竹，东坡作诗忘此诗。\n高丽老茧冰雪古，戏成岁寒岩壑姿。\n纷纷苍霰落碧筱，谡谡好风扶旧枝。\n狰狞头角易变化，细听夜深雷雨时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18260,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"野竹","author":"吴镇","text":"野竹野竹绝可爱，枝叶扶疏有真态。\n生平素守远荆榛，走壁悬厓穿石?。\n虚心抱节山之阿，清风白月聊婆娑。\n寒梢千尺将如何，渭川淇澳风烟多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18261,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"墨菜画卷","author":"吴镇","text":"菘根脱地翠毛湿，雪花翻匙玉肪泣。\n芜蒌金谷暗尘土，美人壮士何颜色。\n山人久刮龟毛毡，囊空不贮揶揄钱。\n屠门大嚼知流涎，淡中滋味吾所便。\n元修元修今几年，一笑不直东坡前。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18262,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"笋","author":"吴镇","text":"绿阴昼静南风来，晴梢拂拂烟花开。\n箨龙走地牙角出，班班玉立横苍苔。\n长镵穿云石路滑，锦衣脱绷玉版白。\n鸣牙未下冰雪齑，开笼先放扬州鹤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18263,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"松泉图","author":"吴镇","text":"长松兮亭亭，流泉兮泠泠。\n漱白石兮散晴雪，舞天风兮吟秋声。\n景幽佳兮足静赏，中有人兮眉长清。\n松兮泉兮何所拟，砚池阴阴兮清彻底。\n挂高堂兮素壁间，夜半风雷兮忽飞起。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18264,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题草亭诗意图","author":"吴镇","text":"依村构草亭，端方意匠宏。\n林深禽鸟乐，尘远竹松清。\n泉石俱延赏，琴书悦性情。\n何当谢凡近，任适慰平生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18265,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画兰","author":"吴镇","text":"舶趠风下东吴舟，抔土移入漳泉秋。\n初疑紫莛攒翠凤，恍如绿绶萦青虬。\n猗猗九畹易消歇，奕奕百亩多淹留。\n轩窗相逢与一笑，交结三友成风流。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18266,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"林屋山","author":"吴镇","text":"巍巍林屋古灵踪，东隔鼋头只一重。\n旱洞晴云阴洞雨，渔家清笛道家钟。\n绿阴满地三春草，翠盖擎空百尺松。\n知道西南岩壑里，轻风吹处有潜龙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18267,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"慈里山","author":"吴镇","text":"慈里山居林屋西，绕山碧磴接丹梯。\n几时桑柘深深圃，数里葭蒹狭狭溪。\n晓月禅家钟发早，夕阳樵唱担归齐。\n亨衢南去平如砥，□□骄骢□□蹄。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18268,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪竹","author":"吴镇","text":"董宣之烈，严颜之节。\n斫头不屈，强项风雪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18269,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"露竹","author":"吴镇","text":"晴霏光煜煜，皎日影曈曈。\n为问东华尘，何如北窗风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18270,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题画","author":"吴镇","text":"老枫化为人，老杉化为石。\n庄周与胡蝶，后来谁复易。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18271,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"一叶竹为竹叟禅师作","author":"吴镇","text":"谁云古多福，三茎四茎曲。\n一叶砚池秋，清风满淇澳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18272,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹谱","author":"吴镇","text":"初画不自知，忽忘笔在手。\n庖丁及轮扁，还识此意否？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18273,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"写菜","author":"吴镇","text":"菜叶阑干长，花开黄金细。\n直须咬到根，方识澹中味。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18274,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"衣杵山","author":"吴镇","text":"谁家捣衣杵，苍然古色深。\n此杵徒在此，秋到不鸣砧。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18275,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"舍山","author":"吴镇","text":"巍然一舍起，载上塔层层。\n七十二峰外，还逢见佛灯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18276,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怪石","author":"吴镇","text":"湖洞露鼋头，日出曝鼋背。\n龟鼍或傍石，时时觅同类。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18277,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画竹十二首 其八","author":"吴镇","text":"湘妃祠下竹，叶叶著秋声。\n鸾凤清宵下，吹箫坐月明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18278,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题纸上竹","author":"鲜于枢","text":"阴凉生研池，叶叶秋可数。\n京华客梦醒，一片江南雨。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18279,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题竹二十一首 其三","author":"吴镇","text":"东山月生光，照我庭中竹。\n道人发清啸，爱此茕茕独。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18280,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题竹二十一首 其四","author":"吴镇","text":"轻阴护绿苔，清风翻紫箨。\n未参玉版师，先放扬州鹤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18281,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画竹十二首 其九","author":"吴镇","text":"短梢尘不染，密叶影低垂。\n忽起推篷看，潇湘过雨时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18282,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题竹二十一首 其六","author":"吴镇","text":"挺挺霜中节，亭亭月下阴。\n识得虚中理，何事可容心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18283,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画竹十二首 其一","author":"吴镇","text":"霏霏桃李花，竞向春前开。\n如何此君子，四时清风来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18284,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画竹十二首 其三","author":"吴镇","text":"野色入高秋，寒影逝湘水。\n日午思晚凉，清风为谁起。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18285,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题竹二十一首 其九","author":"吴镇","text":"我以墨为戏，翻因墨作奴。\n当年若卤莽，何处役潜夫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18286,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题竹二十一首 其十","author":"吴镇","text":"落落不对俗，娟娟净无尘。\n缅怀湘渭中，岁寒时相亲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18287,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画竹十二首 其六","author":"吴镇","text":"抱节元无心，凌云如有意。\n置之空山巾，凛此君子志。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18288,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画竹十二首 其十","author":"吴镇","text":"碧筱挺奇节，空霏散冷露。\n十年青山游，得此幽贞趣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18289,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题竹二十一首 其十三","author":"吴镇","text":"众木摇落时，此君特苍然。\n节直心愈空，抱独全其天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18290,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画竹十二首 其十一","author":"吴镇","text":"片片落花心，悠悠飞絮意。\n清风明月中，此风不可企。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18291,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题竹二十一首 其十五","author":"吴镇","text":"缅惟潇湘江，千里遥相忆。\n何当守一枝，与子期深密。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18292,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题竹二十一首 其十六","author":"吴镇","text":"娟娟春前花，袅袅风前柳。\n独有此君子，可为岁寒友。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18293,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画竹十二首 其十二","author":"吴镇","text":"日日行青山，无竹不可留。\n可怜春风中，桃李多春愁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18294,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题竹二十一首 其十八","author":"吴镇","text":"叶叶舞清风，梢梢漙白雨。\n此怀谁共赏，山中有巢许。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":18295,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"竹下泊舟图","author"